A False Hydra is a monstrous beast whose many heads sing a song that makes its victims wholly forgotten by everyone around them.

[[People/Dahl|Dahl]] kept one in Old Penthes, beneath [[Geography/Ushas/Penthes|Penthes]], and the party that would found [[Org/Sedecium|Sedecium]] slew it.
